---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="AI Web — AI analysis. Better decisions." description="Multi-agent AI stock analysis with bull, bear, fundamental, news and risk research in one focused workspace.">
  <div class="mobile-sponsor sponsor-slot sponsor-slot--mobile" aria-label="Sponsor">Sponsor</div>
  <div class="landing-frame">
    <aside class="sponsor-slot sponsor-slot--side sponsor-slot--left" aria-label="Advertisement">Advertisement</aside>
    <div class="landing-content">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-copy reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Multi-agent research, made readable</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">AI analysis.<br /><em>Better decisions.</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-lede">Multi-agent AI stock analysis that studies a stock from multiple angles, then brings the evidence together into one considered conclusion.</p>
          <form class="analyze-form" data-analyze-form>
            <label for="hero-symbol">What should we research?</label>
            <div class="analyze-controls">
              <div class="ticker-control"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="hero-symbol" name="symbol" type="text" maxlength="8" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Enter a ticker, e.g. NVDA" /><span class="ticker-hint">US</span></div>
              <button class="button button--primary" type="submit">Analyze stock <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
            </div>
            <p class="form-message" data-form-message aria-live="polite"></p>
          </form>
          <div class="popular-tickers" aria-label="Popular tickers"><span>Try</span><button type="button" data-ticker="AAPL">AAPL</button><button type="button" data-ticker="NVDA">NVDA</button><button type="button" data-ticker="MSFT">MSFT</button><button type="button" data-ticker="AMZN">AMZN</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit-glow"></div><div class="orbit-ring orbit-ring--one"></div><div class="orbit-ring orbit-ring--two"></div><div class="planet"><span></span></div><div class="signal signal--one"></div><div class="signal signal--two"></div></div>
      </section>
      <section class="capability-strip" aria-label="AI Web capabilities">
        <div><strong>7</strong><span>research perspectives</span></div><div><strong>Bull + bear</strong><span>balanced debate</span></div><div><strong>One view</strong><span>portfolio-manager style conclusion</span></div>
      </section>
      <section class="section intro-section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A fuller picture</p><h2 id="how-title">Research is stronger<br /><span>when it disagrees.</span></h2></div>
        <div class="section-body"><p>AI Web coordinates focused research roles so you can see the market context, fundamentals, news, sentiment and risks that shape a stock’s story.</p><a class="text-link" href="/auth">Explore the workspace <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      </section>
      <section class="team-section" id="research-team" aria-labelledby="team-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The research team</p><h2 id="team-title">Many angles.<br /><span>One clear brief.</span></h2></div>
        <div class="team-grid">
          <article class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">01</span><div class="card-icon">⌁</div><h3>Market context</h3><p>Understand the environment around the company, from broader trends to market conditions.</p></article>
          <article class="feature-card feature-card--accent"><span class="card-index">02</span><div class="card-icon">◫</div><h3>Fundamentals</h3><p>Examine business quality, financial performance and the evidence behind the numbers.</p></article>
          <article class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">03</span><div class="card-icon">◌</div><h3>News & sentiment</h3><p>Surface relevant narratives and signals without confusing attention for conviction.</p></article>
          <article class="feature-card"><span class="card-index">04</span><div class="card-icon">◇</div><h3>Risk & debate</h3><p>Make room for the bear case, uncertainty and the questions worth asking next.</p></article>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="workflow-section" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
        <div class="workflow-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2 id="workflow-title">From ticker<br /><span>to perspective.</span></h2></div><ol class="workflow-list"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Choose a stock</strong><p>Start with a ticker from the supported research universe.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Let the team investigate</strong><p>Focused perspectives gather the context behind the company.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Read the brief</strong><p>Get the evidence, tensions and conclusion in one place.</p></div></li></ol></div>
      </section>
      <section class="closing-cta" aria-labelledby="closing-title"><p class="eyebrow">Start with a question</p><h2 id="closing-title">Make room for<br /><em>better research.</em></h2><a class="button button--primary" href="/auth">Open your workspace <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
    </div>
    <aside class="sponsor-slot sponsor-slot--side sponsor-slot--right" aria-label="Advertisement">Advertisement</aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
